    <string name="privacy_text">Court Vision AI does not collect, transmit or sell any data.\n\n• The app has no internet permission: videos, statistics and settings never leave your phone unless you export and share a file yourself.\n• There are no accounts, logins, analytics, advertising SDKs, crash reporters or hidden telemetry.\n• Camera and microphone are used only while you are on the recording screen. The microphone is optional.\n• Player names are local labels stored only on this device.\n• No face recognition is performed; players are followed by position and clothing colours only.\n• Cloud backup by the system is disabled; you can create local ZIP backups yourself.\n• Deleting a session removes its data and recorded videos from this phone.</string>
